Notorious RGB RBG Riso: This design response, \'93Notorious RGB RBG, Riso\'94, distorts the image and words of Ruth Bader Ginsburg, unraveling the veneer of the \'91Cult of Personality\'92 that elevates her into an untouchable icon. The work probes the tension between reverence and reality through layered riso visuals and warped text, excerpts from some of her most famous quotes, exposing the dangers of flattening a complex figure into a saintly caricature. It questions how society constructs\'97and risks losing\'97the humanity behind the myth.\
